<article class="env-lemma" id="01AA">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/01AA">Lemma <span data-tag="01AA">115.10.1</span>.</a> Assumptions and notation as in Simplicial, Lemma <a href="/tag/01A6" data-tag="01A6">14.32.1</a>. There exists a section $g : U \to V$ to the morphism $f$ and the composition $g \circ f$ is homotopy equivalent to the identity on $V$. In particular, the morphism $f$ is a homotopy equivalence. </p>
